      "Complete full social history, occupation, and family genealogy; takes too long and is unnecessary for emergency surgery",
      "Ensure H&P is documented by surgeon/provider in chart; verify signed consent is present; confirm labs (CBC, CMP, coagulation studies) are available for anesthesia",
