      "Report the vitals trend immediately to the surgical team and anesthesiologist; hypertension and tachycardia in the context of hemorrhage may indicate inadequate anesthesia/analgesia allowing sympathetic surge, or hemorrhagic shock compensation—intervention depends on cause (deeper anesthesia vs. blood transfusion vs. surgical hemostasis)",
