    a: "Support oxygenation (increase FiO2 to 100%, ensure adequate ventilation), secure IV access for fluids/meds, notify surgical team to STOP procedure, prepare for possible transfer to ICU, monitor for right heart strain (JVD, increased CVP) and subsequent left heart failure as emboli shower through lungs",
